#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:27
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"\nA powerful graphical interface for managing ASUS ROG, TUF, and ProArt "
"laptops on Linux. It acts as the official GUI for the asusctl toolset, "
"allowing for seamless hardware tuning without the command line."
msgstr ""
"\nUna potente interfaz gráfica para administrar portátiles ASUS ROG, TUF y ProArt "
"en Linux. Funciona como la GUI oficial para el conjunto de herramientas asusctl, "
"permitiendo un ajuste perfecto del hardware sin usar la línea de comandos."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:32
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr "Funcionalidades clave:"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:36
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"      • Performance: Switch power profiles and customize fan curves."
"\n      • Aura Sync: Control keyboard backlighting and LED effects.\n      "
"• Battery Health: Set charge limits to extend battery longevity.\n      • "
"Display: Toggle Panel Overdrive and refresh rates.\n      • AniMe Matrix: "
"Control AniMe Matrix displays."
msgstr ""
"      • Rendimiento: Cambia los perfiles de energía y personaliza las curvas de los ventiladores."
"\n      • Aura Sync: Controla la retroiluminación del teclado y los efectos LED.\n      "
"• Salud de la batería: Establece límites de carga para prolongar su vida útil.\n      • "
"Pantalla: Activa o desactiva el Overdrive del panel y la tasa de refresco.\n      • AniMe Matrix: "
"Controla las pantallas AniMe Matrix."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:41
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Requirements:"
msgstr "Requisitos:"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:46
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"      This software requires kernel version 6.19 or later. However due to "
"active development, the latest kernel is always the recommended one."
msgstr ""
"      Este software requiere la versión del kernel 6.19 o posterior. Sin embargo, debido al "
"desarrollo activo, siempre se recomienda utilizar el kernel más reciente."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:51
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Work in progress:"
msgstr "En desarrollo:"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:55
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"      • Theme the widgets\n      • Add a cpu/gpu temp/fan speed info "
"bar\n      • Include fan speeds, temps in a bottom bar\n      • Screenpad "
"controls\n      • ROG Ally specific settings"
msgstr ""
"      • Aplicar temas a los widgets\n      • Añadir una barra de información sobre la temp. de CPU/GPU y velocidad de ventiladores"
"\n      • Incluir velocidades de ventilador y temperaturas en una barra inferior\n      • Controles de Screenpad"
"\n      • Ajustes específicos para ROG Ally"

